# Project-relative Cursor plans

Store Emberwood plans in **`.cursor/plans/*.plan.md`** with frontmatter `isProject: true`.

Do **not** leave new Emberwood plans only in `~/.cursor/plans/`. If a plan was created in the home plans folder, move/copy it into `.cursor/plans/` and set `isProject: true` (optional thin stub in `~/.cursor/plans/` pointing here).

Canonical set lives in the repo so plans travel with the project and show the Project badge.
